            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Gambira enju ya Israeli oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyashiisha Omwanya gwangye ogurikwera, ogurikubareetera amaryo, mukeemanya ku mwine amaani, ogu amaisho gaanyu gashemerererwa, kandi ogutuura gubatwaire emitima. Kandi batabani baanyu na bahara baanyu abu mwatsigireho baryaitwa rurara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
