            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Okwo nikwo Ezekieli aribabeera eky'okureeberaho; oku atwarize kwona, nikwo naimwe muritwaza. Ebyo ku biriba byabaireho, muryamanya ku ndi Mukama RUHANGA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
