        {
          "text": " Naiwe, Mwana w'omuntu, aha izooba eri ndibaihiraho orugo rwabo orugumire, orubahaisa okushemererwa n'ekitiinisa, oru batuuzaho amaisho, kandi orutuura rubatwaire emitima, kandi nkagaruka nkabaihaho batabani baabo na bahara baabo, ",
